---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Post 20 (Alpha) figure: loop. Inline SVG, site tokens only. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp20-loop">
  <div class="atp20-loop-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="A loop of four steps: propose a formula, score it on history, keep the best, vary them, then repeat. A warning notes that the score is the only feedback and every round reads the same history.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The search loop, and the one thing it listens to</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vòng lặp tìm kiếm và thứ duy nhất nó nghe theo</tspan></text>
<rect x="30" y="60" width="190" height="84" rx="8" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="idea" x={125} y={86} size={26} />
<text x="125" y="128" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Propose a formula</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đề xuất một công thức</tspan></text>
<rect x="255" y="60" width="190" height="84" rx="8" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="chart" x={350} y={86} size={26} />
<text x="350" y="128" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Score it on history</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chấm trên dữ liệu quá khứ</tspan></text>
<rect x="480" y="60" width="190" height="84" rx="8" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="ok" x={575} y={86} size={26} />
<text x="575" y="128" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Keep the best ones</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ lại những cái tốt nhất</tspan></text>
<rect x="705" y="60" width="190" height="84" rx="8" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="sync" x={800} y={86} size={26} />
<text x="800" y="128" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Vary them</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biến đổi chúng</tspan></text>
<line x1="222" y1="102" x2="245.0" y2="102.0" class="ln fm-flow" /><polygon points="253,102 245.0,98.0 245.0,106.0" class="arrf" />
<line x1="447" y1="102" x2="470.0" y2="102.0" class="ln fm-flow" /><polygon points="478,102 470.0,98.0 470.0,106.0" class="arrf" />
<line x1="672" y1="102" x2="695.0" y2="102.0" class="ln fm-flow" /><polygon points="703,102 695.0,98.0 695.0,106.0" class="arrf" />
<path d="M 800 146 L 800 190 L 125 190 L 125 148" class="ln" fill="none" />
<polygon points="125,146 121,156 129,156" class="arrf" />
<text x="462" y="184" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>repeat for a few hundred generations</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lặp vài trăm thế hệ</tspan></text>
<rect x="255" y="212" width="440" height="64" rx="8" class="badb" />
<DiagramIcon name="warning" x={283} y={244} size={24} />
<text x="305" y="238" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>The score is the only feedback, and every round reads</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điểm số là phản hồi duy nhất, và vòng nào cũng đọc</tspan></text>
<text x="305" y="258" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>the same history. Whatever is lucky in it gets selected.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng một đoạn lịch sử. Phần may mắn trong đó sẽ được chọn.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Genetic programming and tree search differ in how they propose and vary. The scoring step is the same in both.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Genetic programming và tree search khác nhau ở cách đề xuất và biến đổi. Bước chấm điểm thì giống nhau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp20-loop { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp20-loop-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp20-loop svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp20-loop text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp20-loop .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-loop .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-loop .xs { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-loop .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-loop .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-loop .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-loop .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-loop .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp20-loop .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-loop .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-loop .node { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-loop .leaf { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-loop .nodeg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-loop .noder { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-loop .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .atp20-loop .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-loop .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-loop .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-loop .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-loop .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-loop .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-loop .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp20-loop .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp20-loop .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp20-loop .tick { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .atp20-loop figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>